 enjoy. YOUR STORY SO FAR (what you\'ve actually done — your past, not the future): All eight Gym Badges are yours. The Elite Four and the Champion are the summit.. THINGS YOU\'VE HEARD AND READ (from people and signs — your own notes, use them when they point somewhere): "OAK. Er-hem! Congratulations, KIRA! This floor is the POK.MON HALL OF FAME. POK.MON LEAGUE CHAMPIONS are honored for their exploits here. Their POK.MON are also"; "I had a vision of your arrival. I have had psychic powers since I was a child. It started when a spoon I carelessly tossed, bent. I dislike battling, but if you"; "Sealed within that TM06 lies TOXIC! It is a secret technique dating back some four hundred years."; "KIRA put the TM06 in the TM CASE.". YOUR PLAN — right now: You\'re ready — stop grinding and push forward to the next objective. Next: FIRST the gift Eevee — a guaranteed Poke Ball in the Celadon Condominiums roof room (back stairwell). One of a kind: a Thunder Stone from the Dept. Store turns it into Jolteon, the team\'s electric answer — the gym comes right after; that errand is the road. Bigger picture: Enjoy the post-game as Champion (Cerulean Cave, the Pokédex). Your team right now: blastoise (L94), moltres (L56), articuno (L53), zapdos (L55). Remember YOU are the one playing this — narrate your plan to chat in your own voice (first person: "I\'m grinding", "my team"), and never ask anyone what you\'re doing or who\'s on your team — you know.. RECALIBRATE — before the last detour you\'d set out to: "head back to Route 21 — wild Pokémon to catch and level up". That\'s still available. Unless something fundamental has actually changed, pick it back up and continue — don\'t lose the thread to aimless wandering.', 'progress': "8 badge(s) earned (Boulder, Cascade, Thunder, Rainbow, Soul, Marsh, Volcano, Earth). You're the CHAMPION — the game is beaten. This is the post-game victory lap. Pokédex: 20 caught. Champion. The credits rolled — everything from here is the victory lap 